{"page": 93, "lines": [{"t": "DSP-2232 OPERATING MANUAL", "x": 265.0, "y": 71.0}, {"t": "MAILDROP OPERATION", "x": 1518.0, "y": 74.0}, {"t": "5.5. 5", "x": 266.0, "y": 189.0}, {"t": "5.5. 6", "x": 255.0, "y": 1466.0}, {"t": "12/91", "x": 250.0, "y": 2517.0}, {"t": "SEND Messages", "x": 470.0, "y": 193.0}, {"t": "You 've killed the message and wish to SEND a reply to the Mail Drop' B", "x": 469.0, "y": 269.0}, {"t": "operator, WX2BBB. Again you see the Mail Drop's prompt. Remember the", "x": 469.0, "y": 309.0}, {"t": "number after the right bracket \" ) \" shows you how much memory space ig", "x": 469.0, "y": 348.0}, {"t": "available in the Mail Drop. Always verify that the Mail Drop hag enough", "x": 468.0, "y": 387.0}, {"t": "memory remaining for the length of message you intend to send.", "x": 467.0, "y": 427.0}, {"t": "[AEA DSP-2232) 16704 free > {MailDrop'g prompt}", "x": 472.0, "y": 507.0}, {"t": "Now, type \"S (callsign] \" to SEND a message to the Mail Drop's SYSOP. If", "x": 466.0, "y": 587.0}, {"t": "you omit the call sign, the Mail Drop will address the message to the", "x": 466.0, "y": 626.0}, {"t": "MYMAIL or MYCALL call sign. Messages sent with the S command are", "x": 464.0, "y": 667.0}, {"t": "considered Private unless they are sent to \"ALL\" or to \"QST\"", "x": 465.0, "y": 705.0}, {"t": "S WX2BBB", "x": 464.0, "y": 787.0}, {"t": "Subj ect :", "x": 464.0, "y": 826.0}, {"t": "1 WILL BE GOING", "x": 465.0, "y": 868.0}, {"t": "Enter message,", "x": 463.0, "y": 907.0}, {"t": "-Z (CTRL-Z) or /EX to", "x": 770.0, "y": 907.0}, {"t": "YEAH, 1 GOT THE MAILING", "x": 462.0, "y": 988.0}, {"t": "AND WILL", "x": 949.0, "y": 990.0}, {"t": "BE GLAD TO PICK YOU UP.", "x": 463.0, "y": 1027.0}, {"t": "WHAT TIME", "x": 968.0, "y": 1030.0}, {"t": "DO YOU WANT ME THERE? IS MARY", "x": 462.0, "y": 1067.0}, {"t": "GOING? CUL. WXIAAA", "x": 461.0, "y": 1108.0}, {"t": "[AEA DSP-2232J", "x": 466.0, "y": 1229.0}, {"t": "16508 free (A, B, H, J,", "x": 788.0, "y": 1229.0}, {"t": "{The \" SEND call sign\" command}", "x": 1279.0, "y": 786.0}, {"t": "{Mail Drop's Subject prompt}", "x": 1280.0, "y": 827.0}, {"t": "{Your subject entry}", "x": 1279.0, "y": 868.0}, {"t": "{Mail Drop answers you}", "x": 1382.0, "y": 908.0}, {"t": "end", "x": 1213.0, "y": 909.0}, {"t": "{Type your message to WX2BBB}", "x": 1279.0, "y": 987.0}, {"t": "{End the message with / EX}", "x": 1280.0, "y": 1146.0}, {"t": "> {Mail Drop's prompt}", "x": 1482.0, "y": 1228.0}, {"t": "NOTE :", "x": 460.0, "y": 1309.0}, {"t": "If the message was ended with the \" /EX\" ,", "x": 665.0, "y": 1309.0}, {"t": "contain a \" / E\" when the message is read.", "x": 663.0, "y": 1349.0}, {"t": "the <CTRL—Z> to end messages .", "x": 663.0, "y": 1389.0}, {"t": "the last line will", "x": 1502.0, "y": 1307.0}, {"t": "To avoid this, use", "x": 1522.0, "y": 1348.0}, {"t": "LQ_g Off and Disconnect", "x": 457.0, "y": 1468.0}, {"t": "You 're f inished with this session. Time to log off the Mail Drop.", "x": 458.0, "y": 1549.0}, {"t": "[AEA DSP-2232) 16508 free > {MailDrop's prompt}", "x": 463.0, "y": 1630.0}, {"t": "Now, type \"B\" (for Bye) to LOG OFF the Mail Drop.", "x": 457.0, "y": 1712.0}, {"t": "{The Bye command}", "x": 1488.0, "y": 1791.0}, {"t": "The Mail Drop issues an immediate disconnect command to your DSP—2232", "x": 456.0, "y": 1871.0}, {"t": "and the connection is over.", "x": 457.0, "y": 1913.0}, {"t": "* * DI S CONNECTED", "x": 458.0, "y": 1994.0}, {"t": "{DSP—2232is status line}", "x": 1385.0, "y": 1992.0}, {"t": "5-9", "x": 1053.0, "y": 2522.0}]}